		{"id":"fc7d8a1680b817e7","type":"text","text":"##### animiertes Pronomen\n\n*Er denkt an sie.*\n>[!NOTE]+\n>Аналогично, как и с существительными","x":-240,"y":-184,"width":521,"height":244},
		{"id":"d7cc57eb138fad84","type":"text","text":"Verb mit Präposition +","x":255,"y":-380,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bba79d007cfaf295","type":"text","text":"##### Fragesatz\n> Präposition + wen/wem\n\n*An wen denkst du?*\n\n> [!NOTE]+ Падежные формы **wer**\n> Представлены падежами Akkusativ/Dativ","x":-240,"y":120,"width":521,"height":320},
		{"id":"07080a29351e8916","type":"text","text":"##### unbelebtes Pronomen\n> **da + (r) + Präposition**\n\n*Er denkt daran.*\n\n\n","x":347,"y":-178,"width":427,"height":206},
		{"id":"0fbadbd485683a47","type":"text","text":"##### Nomen\n\n*Er denkt die ganze Zeit an die Arbet.*\n>[!NOTE]+ \n>Чтобы корректно использовать учим сочетания глаголов с предлогами (управление)","x":-800,"y":-184,"width":520,"height":244},
		{"id":"1de89ced11937270","type":"text","text":"##### Fragesatz\n\n> **wo + (r) + Präposition**\n\n*Woran denkst du?*\n*Worin liegt das Problem?*","x":347,"y":60,"width":427,"height":180},
